%% AID-DRAS / RADAR System Architecture Diagram
graph TD
    subgraph Data Sources & Ingestion
        IMD[IMD 0.25° Gridded Rainfall<br/>1901-2024]
        Census[Census 2011<br/>Socio-Technical Deficits]
        Feeds[Live API Feeds<br/>USGS / GDACS / NASA / Open-Meteo]
    end

    subgraph PySpark & HDFS Research Pipeline (RADAR)
        ETL[PySpark ETL & Grid Mapping<br/>District-Day Panel Engine]
        ML[Spark MLlib Classifiers<br/>RF / GBT / Logistic Regression]
        Calib[Isotonic Calibration &<br/>Split-Conformal Risk Bounds (α=0.10)]
        DDRPS[DDRPS 2.0 Priority Engine<br/>Weighted Composite Scoring]
        LP[Pre-Positioning LP Solver<br/>Uncertainty-Aware Allocation]
    end

    subgraph Serving & Storage Layer
        PostGIS[(PostgreSQL / PostGIS<br/>District Geometries & Incidents)]
        Redis[(Redis Pub/Sub & Cache<br/>Real-Time Alert Dispatch)]
    end

    subgraph Full-Stack Web Platform (AID-DRAS)
        NodeBackend[Node.js / Express API<br/>TypeScript Backend]
        OSRM[OSRM Route Engine<br/>Multi-Risk Escape Polylines]
        ReactUI[React + Vite Frontend<br/>Interactive GIS & AI Simulator]
    end

    IMD --> ETL
    Census --> DDRPS
    Feeds --> NodeBackend
    ETL --> ML
    ML --> Calib
    Calib --> DDRPS
    DDRPS --> LP
    LP --> PostGIS
    NodeBackend --> PostGIS
    NodeBackend --> Redis
    NodeBackend --> OSRM
    ReactUI <--> NodeBackend
